## Web renderer (future, design only)

Same DagProgress model, different display:

    1. Serialize DagProgress to JSON
    2. Stream via SSE (server-sent events) or WebSocket
    3. Browser renders with SVG/Canvas
    4. Glyph system's emoji tier maps directly to web display
    5. CSS animations triggered by EdgeState::Flowing
    6. Click nodes to expand OutputSummary

Because DagProgress derives Serialize, the web renderer is just
`serde_json::to_string(&progress)` piped to a connection.
No new data model needed.

